Please cite racoon_clip and the relevant experimental modules:

racoon_clip
Klostermann & Zarnack 2024:
racoon_clip—a complete pipeline for single-nucleotide analyses of iCLIP and eCLIP data
https://doi.org/10.1093/bioadv/vbae084

miR-eCLIP module
Verheyden & Klostermann et al. 2024:
A high-resolution map of functional miR-181 response elements in the thymus reveals the role of coding sequence targeting and an alternative seed match
https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gkae416

iCLIP3 protocol including a racoon_clip walk-through
Despic et al. 2026:
iCLIP3: A streamlined, non-radioactive protocol for mapping protein-RNA interactions in cellular transcripts at single-nucleotide resolution
https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.03.01.708747

Original pipeline used by racoon_clip
Busch et al. 2020:
iCLIP data analysis: A complete pipeline from sequencing reads to RBP binding sites
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ymeth.2019.11.008
